## **Red Tokyo Tower Night Ticket** 🗼

**Overview:**
Tokyo Tower features Japan's largest next-generation digital playground spread across three floors with dozens of high-tech attractions suitable for all ages.

**What's Included:**
- 🎟️ Admission Ticket
- 📶 WiFi on board
- 💰 All Fees and Taxes
- 🚻 Restroom on board
- 🎢 Unlimited rides on all attractions

**Main Attractions:**
- **Red Light Green Light** - Interactive game from the popular Korean drama
- **AR Bouldering & AR Dodgeball** - Nearly 20 high-tech attractions
- **Robot Fight** - Live robot battles (requires additional fee, started April 24, 2024)
- **VR Ride Attractions** - Latest VR experiences exclusive to Japan (opened January 26, 2024), including a 360-degree rotating VR ride
- **E-Motor Simulation Area** - Full-scale motorsports simulation
- **Digital Retro Games** - Nostalgic Japanese gaming experience

**Price:** Starting from **$25.29 USD**

**Accessibility & Requirements:**
✅ Wheelchair accessible
✅ Service animals allowed
✅ Public transportation nearby
✅ Prams/strollers allowed
⚠️ Height restrictions apply for some attractions
⚠️ Not recommended for pregnant travelers, those with spinal injuries, or poor cardiovascular health
⚠️ Moderate physical fitness level required
⚠️ Must be 18+ to book or accompanied by an adult

**Cancellation Policy:** ✅ Free cancellation available

**Location:** Tokyo, Japan

This looks like an amazing high-tech entertainment experience at one of Tokyo's most iconic landmarks!

